<title>DENMARK: Jyske Bank sets Hypotekbanken bond price.</title>
<headline>Jyske Bank sets Hypotekbanken bond price.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish Jyske Bank said on Tuesday it set the price of Hypotekbanken's four percent, six year 800 million crown bond announced last week at 90.44.</p>
<p>It said the bond loan was jointly arranged by Gudme Raaschou and Jyske Bank, giving no more details.</p>
<p>The issue was originally announced on November 1, with the bond to be listed on Copenhagen Stock Exchange on November 8, 1996.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom  +45-33969652</p>
</text>
